<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	  Only the keys Xcode cannot generate live here. GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE is
	  also YES, so the standard bundle keys are merged in at build time.
	-->

	<!-- This build is for Korean readers only: the brief is written in Korean and
	     read by a Korean voice, so the bundle declares Korean as its one language
	     rather than following the device. -->
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>모닝 브리핑</string>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>ko</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>ko</string>
	</array>

	<!-- `audio` is what lets the hands-free readout speak at the set time while
	     the app is in the background. `fetch` lets the background refresh keep
	     the pre-rendered notification sound current. -->
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>audio</string>
		<string>fetch</string>
	</array>

	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>com.morningbrief.refresh</string>
	</array>

	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>오늘과 내일의 일정을 읽어 하루의 모양을 그리고 소리로 읽어 주기 위해 캘린더를 사용해요.</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>오늘 실제로 챙겨야 할 일을 알려 주기 위해 마감이 있는 미리 알림을 읽어요.</string>

	<!-- Kept for iOS versions before the full-access split. -->
	<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>오늘과 내일의 일정을 읽어 하루의 모양을 그리고 소리로 읽어 주기 위해 캘린더를 사용해요.</string>
	<key>NSRemindersUsageDescription</key>
	<string>오늘 실제로 챙겨야 할 일을 알려 주기 위해 마감이 있는 미리 알림을 읽어요.</string>

	<!-- The app uses only HTTPS via system libraries, so it qualifies for the
	     exemption. Declaring it here skips the export-compliance prompt on every
	     TestFlight upload. -->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
<key>UIRequiresFullScreen</key>
<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
